OL,3,AHow Blackpool gets ready for Strictly
OL,4,ACome Dancing
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong before the sequins start to
OL,7,Fsparkle under the lights and the judges
OL,8,Fprepare to lift their paddles to
OL,9,Fdeliver their scores, Blackpool Tower
OL,10,FBallroom is a hive of activity.
OL,12,FI have arrived here before Strictly
OL,13,FCome Dancing returns to our screens
OL,14,Ffrom the famous ballroom.
OL,16,FWhile instantly recognisable, the venue
OL,17,Fis very different from what BBC One
OL,18,Fviewers will see on Saturday night.
